“What Nepal is doing by submitting the request is genuine and right,” Raju Pandit Chhetri, executive director of the environmental non-profit Prakriti Resources Centre, told This Week in Asia. “The support that Nepal might get may be minuscule, but it will send a significant message symbolically and set a precedent for other countries.”

